      "guid": "com.acidphantasm.devbalaclavafix",
      "name": "Dev Balaclava Fix",
      "slug": "dev-balaclava-fix",
      "teaser": "Just makes you actually invincible while wearing the Dev Balaclava. Meant for mod developers. Immune to explosions, border snipers, BTR running you over, etc",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2609.png",
      "downloads": 11606,
      "favourites_count": 12,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Dev Balaclava Fix</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the BepInEx folder in the zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the BepInEx folder from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">SUPPORT</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Please comment on the hub page, or preferably create an issue on the GitHub, or <em>more</em> preferably visit #acidphantasm-mods in the SPT Discord!</p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
